# Line endings are load-bearing: Windows autocrlf checkouts once mangled two
# CRLF-sensitive test inputs (an all-ASCII PDF fixture whose xref offsets
# shifted, and a golden journal whose content hashes changed) — git's text
# heuristic sees no NUL bytes and "helpfully" converts. Pin the file classes
# that must stay byte-exact on every platform.
*.sema text eol=lf linguist-language=Scheme
*.sh text eol=lf
crates/sema/tests/fixtures/** -text
